=== layout: one-panel

# [Join 1]{color=#D40000}: Update the Distances

@body

Average the original distances between genes in the two clusters.

- ac to b: (11 + 9) / 2 = 10
- ac to d: (12 + 10) / 2 = 11
- ac to e: (7 + 9) / 2 = 8
- ac to f: (14 + 12) / 2 = 13

